    (m_117_h_r_5323, 'israel_support', 100, true, 'yea_supports',
      'Appropriates $1,000,000,000 to Procurement, Defense-Wide to replace Iron Dome interceptors and components Israel expended in the May 2021 conflict, and for Israeli cooperative missile-defense procurement, designated as an emergency requirement. Introduced as a standalone bill after the same money was stripped from the continuing resolution, so the vote is on Israeli missile defense and nothing else. A yea funds it.',
